---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Forms from '../components/Forms.astro';
import Close from '../components/Close.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Individual counselling" description="Individual counselling in Victoria, BC and virtual across BC with Rachel Glover, RCC. Better understand yourself and the relationships in your life.">
  <div class="wrap"><section class="pg-hero">
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--d:.1s">Individual counselling</p>
      <h1 class="b-h1"><span class="mask"><span style="--d:.2s">Change starts</span></span><span class="mask acc"><span style="--d:.36s">with you.</span></span></h1>
      <p class="lede rise" style="--d:.65s">Sometimes the only person you can change is yourself. Individual counselling can help you understand what’s keeping you stuck and make changes that carry into your everyday life.</p>
      <div class="rise" style="--d:.8s;display:flex;gap:14px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center"><a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free 15-minute consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a><span class="where-line">In-person in Victoria · Virtual across BC</span></div>
    </div>
    <Forms kind="one" />
  </section></div>

  <section class="band alt"><div class="wrap split2">
    <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What brings people in</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">Perhaps you…</h2></div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <ul class="checks stagger">
        <li>Are struggling in a relationship.</li>
        <li>Find it difficult to set boundaries.</li>
        <li>Are dealing with complicated family dynamics.</li>
        <li>Are facing a major life change.</li>
        <li>Keep finding yourself in the same situations, having the same reactions or putting everyone else’s needs ahead of your own.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div></section>


  <section class="band"><div class="wrap split2">
    <div class="reveal"><h2 class="b-h1 h2">You can’t control everything. <span class="acc">But you have more influence than you might think.</span></h2></div>
    <div class="reveal stack">
      <p class="body">We can’t always change the people around us or the circumstances we find ourselves in. But we can learn to understand our own reactions, communicate our needs, set boundaries and make different choices.</p>
      <p class="body">Sometimes changing how you respond, what you accept or what you ask for can change the way a relationship works, even when the other person isn’t in counselling.</p>
      <p class="body">Together, we’ll look at what’s happening in your life, what is and isn’t within your control, and where you can begin making changes that matter to you.</p>
      <ul class="fee-list" style="margin-top:12px"><li><span class="what">Individual session</span><span class="len">60 min</span><span class="amt">$140</span></li></ul>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <Close />
</Base>
